# 詞： 睇怕

1. 天咁黑，睇怕就快落大雨喇。 (The sky is so dark, it looks like it's going to rain heavily soon.)
2. 佢遲到咗成個鐘，睇怕今日個會開唔成。 (He's an hour late, it seems like today's meeting can't go ahead.)
3. 呢間餐廳排咗咁長龍，睇怕要等兩個鐘先有位。 (The queue at this restaurant is so long, it looks like we'll have to wait two hours for a table.)
4. 佢病咗幾日都唔去睇醫生，睇怕個病會愈嚟愈嚴重。 (He's been sick for days without seeing a doctor, it seems like his illness will get worse and worse.)
5. 呢個月使咗咁多錢，睇怕要食幾個月嘅即食麵先掂。 (We've spent so much money this month, it looks like we'll have to eat instant noodles for a few months.)
6. 老闆今日黑口黑面，睇怕有人要俾人鬧喇。 (The boss looks so gloomy today, it seems like someone is going to get scolded.)
7. 個波咁入唔到，睇怕我哋今場輸硬。 (The ball didn't go in, it looks like we're definitely going to lose this game.)
8. 佢咁夜都未返屋企，睇怕今晚要加班喇。 (He still hasn't come home so late, it seems like he has to work overtime tonight.)
9. 呢隻股票跌成咁，睇怕短期內都升唔返上去。 (This stock has fallen so much, it seems like it won't recover in the short term.)
10. 你咁樣日日熬夜，睇怕遲早捱壞個身體。 (You stay up late every day like this, it looks like you'll ruin your health sooner or later.)

完成10句例句 [end of text]


